# Planted bugs for the wait-for-rollout design. Each one must make its
# property fail.
run fv-tlc ReleaseOrdering.tla WaitForRollout.cfg WitnessContracts.cfg
properties NeverStrandsOldVersion EventuallyMigrated
file ReleaseOrdering.tla

mutation the rollout check forgets to require every instance
detects NeverStrandsOldVersion
-     /\ Order = "wait_for_rollout" /\ phase = "migrate" /\ AllUpgraded
+     /\ Order = "wait_for_rollout" /\ phase = "migrate"

mutation upgrading stays possible but nothing ever requires it to happen
detects EventuallyMigrated
- Work == (\E i \in Instances : UpgradeOne(i)) \/ UpgradeAll \/ AdvanceToMigrate \/ ContractTooEarly \/ ContractAfterRollout
- Next == Work \/ Done
+ Work == UpgradeAll \/ AdvanceToMigrate \/ ContractTooEarly \/ ContractAfterRollout
+ Next == Work \/ (\E i \in Instances : UpgradeOne(i)) \/ Done

harmless a comment on the rollout-gated contract
- \* Source: migration.contract(), dropping the old column only once every
+ \* Source: migration.contract(). It drops the old column only once every
